{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "story_sunbr_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_sunbr_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "缺失的陪伴",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_sunbr_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "e023b88a68dd7c016c8e4311a9a94ae4fed68d32753a1bd243134129dbb3705e",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_snowconutryinside"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉达",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "发绳、水杯，还有这个抱枕......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉达",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这些都要带走！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉达",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这本书也带上，安娜姐肯定会高兴的。还有这个播放器......索尼娅姐听歌用得上......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉达",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？这张照片是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉达",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉达",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这是......初等学校毕业那天，爸爸妈妈特地回家我们三个人一起拍的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉达",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "爸爸、妈妈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拉达，差不多了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉，虽然也想让你再多待一会，但我们不好在乌萨斯久留，万一被查出身份就糟糕了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "车队留给我们的时间不多，得抓紧了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉达",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，对不起，我很快就好了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉达",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "收拾东西比预想的要多花了一点时间，这里变得有一点点乱，很多东西都找不到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，那群整合运动......当初在城区乱来一气，这都干的什么事儿啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拉达你接下来打算怎么办？还有什么想去的地方吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉达",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......已经没有什么了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉达",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "奶奶过世之后，原本我就是一个人住，所以没关系了，只要把东西收拾好就可以出发啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这样啊......这个年纪就独自生活，真不容易。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉达",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸嘿嘿，还好啦，早就已经习惯了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉达",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "奶奶教了我怎么烹饪，之后好几年都是拉达做饭给奶奶吃哦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真了不起。我听圆规他们几个提过，说来了个会做咱们老家当地特色菜的小姑娘，可惜还没有机会尝到......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不过，拉达，说真的，你真的决定了要和我们一起走吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉达",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么啦，忽然好严肃地问这种问题......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉达",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，我已经决定了！要和索尼娅姐她们在一起！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，你们几个的感情还是那么好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但......我想问的不是这个。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你看，虽然现在是把边缘的地块暂时让其他城市收容，市民也只能暂居在收容区的安置所，但很多事都在逐渐恢复秩序。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "切尔诺伯格迟早会被重建，再等一阵子，回到这里生活也是一个选择。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉达",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉达",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其实......我还不确定，现在只是想和姐姐们在一起，但是之后的事......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉达",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "尖针大叔，我有的时候也会想，如果姐姐们都决定要离开了，安娜姐也好，索尼娅姐也好，都找到了自己要做的事......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉达",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那拉达......之后拉达能去哪里呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉，这个问题我没法替你回答，这需要你自己考虑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拉达，你和安娜她们的情况不太一样，虽然你说自己并不清楚父母的具体工作地点，就连档案馆也没有留下记录......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但如果申请的话，罗德岛也可以帮忙去找......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我觉得可以不用这么仓促地决定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉达",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......才不是仓促决定呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉达",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉达",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道尖针大叔是在替我担心，可是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉达",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是现在我只想陪着姐姐们......只要能大家都在一起，去哪里都可以！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉达",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "以后的事情......拉达也不知道，拉达没有想过......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拉达......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是，你的父母......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉达",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "爸爸妈妈......爸爸妈妈在外面工作，本来就很少回家，也不能告诉拉达工作地点，就连信都很少写......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉达",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就算没有那些坏人袭击城市，我也已经好久好久没有见过爸爸妈妈了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉达",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_indoor_u"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温柔的女性",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拉达，爸爸妈妈要出去工作了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉稳的男性",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拉达在家要听奶奶的话，做个乖孩子等着我们回来，好吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年幼的女孩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......爸爸，妈妈，又要丢下拉达了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年幼的女孩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呜......呜呜......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年幼的女孩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "爸爸妈妈不要走，拉达不想做没有爸妈的孩子......呜......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温柔的女性",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......拉达......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉稳的男性",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "快要到出发时间了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉稳的男性",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拉达，爸爸妈妈必须要走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年幼的女孩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呜......呜哇啊啊啊啊啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年幼的女孩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不要走！爸爸妈妈不要走......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年幼的女孩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不要丢下拉达......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_snowconutryinside"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉达",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......所以，拉达想去哪里都可以自己决定！才没有人会在意呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉达",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一定是这样！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这、这样啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（这小姑娘现在是在......闹别扭？看起来气鼓鼓的。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好吧，你暂时跟着我们一起也好......至少现在这情况，也不能放心让你这个年纪的孩子一个人在这里生活。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果没有别的地方想去，就像索尼娅那姑娘一样，暂时留在罗德岛也行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉达",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔，像索尼娅姐一样当干员？拉达没想过......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当干员可不轻松哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那等你收拾好东西，我们就出发？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉达",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉达",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再等一下下就好！那口锅拉达也想带上......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还要带？可不要超重了啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_snowconutry_4"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "总算是出城了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "前面就是约好的碰头地点，我们来得还算及时。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉达",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谢谢你，尖针大叔！包裹实在装不下这些厨具，真是太麻烦你了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没事，这点东西小意思，反正背锅这事也不是头一回了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉达",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没什么，你别在意......哎，小心！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉达",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哇！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拉达！没事吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉达",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没事没事......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯平民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......拉达？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉达",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯平民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "皇帝在上，真的是你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉达",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是......波琳娜奶奶！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是认识的人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉达",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯！是一直很照顾我的邻居奶奶！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉达",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "波琳娜奶奶，你没事真是太好了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯平民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这句话该我说才对！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯平民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拉达，幸好你没事，当时听说学生们都被关在学校，之后又到处都找不到你，可把我们都急坏了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯平民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你这段时间都上哪儿去了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉达",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我和学校里的姐姐们在一起，有罗德......不对，是有好心人救了我们啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯平民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好心人......？是说旁边的这位先生吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你好，波琳娜大娘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯平民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯平民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（没见过的生面孔，怪模怪样的......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯平民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（我说拉达啊，救你们的人没问题吗，你可不是被骗了吧？！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉达",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（没有啦，尖针大叔真的是特别好的好人！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......咳咳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉达",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好、好啦！比起这个，波琳娜奶奶现在怎么样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉达",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当时那群坏人没有伤到大家吧，杰尼亚大叔呢？克拉拉姐姐呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯平民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎，没事，大家都没事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯平民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们那一片的警察行动得早，带着我们躲进了荒地里避难，这才逃过一劫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯平民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你杰尼亚叔后来也带人到学校去找过你们，但那里没人，我们只好先离开......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯平民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "幸好你没事啊，拉达，真是皇帝陛下保佑！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉达",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "才不是皇帝保佑我们呢，明明是拉达和姐姐们相互保护......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯平民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？拉达，你刚刚说什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉达",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......没什么！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉达",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别担心，波琳娜奶奶，我没事啦，我现在很强哦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉达",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果有坏人敢来欺负大家，一定要告诉拉达，拉达来帮大家把坏人都打跑！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯平民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，我们小拉达现在这么可靠啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉达",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼哼，拉达还会变得更强，更可靠的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉达",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "到时候那些破坏城市的坏人一个都逃不掉，拉达会拿平底锅把他们都拍扁！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你说的平底锅......该不会是我背着的这一口吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉达",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是哦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......很不错的理想。加油。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拉达，时间差不多了，我们该走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉达",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，好的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉达",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那波琳娜奶奶，我要先走了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯平民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "走？等一下，拉达，你不是来找我们的吗？你、你怎么还要离开？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯平民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "虽然我们现在是只能在收容区暂住，但那里条件也还算可以，可能再等一阵子，原本的房屋也会开始重建......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯平民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拉达，你的家不就在这吗？你要走到哪里去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉达",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的家......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉达",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "波琳娜奶奶......能遇到奶奶拉达好开心，但是，但是！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉达",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是拉达现在更想和姐姐们待在一起......安娜姐，索尼娅姐，还有娜塔莉娅姐和罗莎琳姐，拉达不想和大家分开。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉达",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "和姐姐们分开的话，拉达......不知道自己还能做什么，会很害怕......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯平民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拉达......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯平民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要是没地方去，那就回家，和我们一起。我们回家，好不好？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉达",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "波琳娜奶奶，房子毁了，爸爸妈妈不会回来，拉达在这里已经没有家了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉达",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......但是没事的，放心吧波琳娜奶奶，拉达要去的地方很安全的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉达",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "会有很多很好的人，大家都会对拉达很好！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉达",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对吧，尖针大叔？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，至少安全还是可以保证的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们还不至于让像拉达这个年纪的学生面对什么太危险的状况。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉达",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哇......索尼娅姐听到这句话，肯定会生气。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉达",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她都已经决定要申请成为正式干员啦，好像连代号都已经想好了耶！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "饶了我吧，这话我可不敢当她的面说。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯平民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯平民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看来你已经下定决心了......好吧，那我就不多问了，记得要写信回来啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯平民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只要你安全，那我和你杰尼亚叔也能稍微放心了。你出去看看也好，能平安就好......等咱们城市重新建起来了，到时候再回来也不迟......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉达",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯平民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等，拉达！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯平民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还有东西要给你！我就盼着哪天能找到你，所以一直随身带着。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯平民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这个给你，这是你爸妈前几年走之前托我们家代为保管的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉达",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......欸？爸爸妈妈的东西？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯平民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "本来是说等你中学毕业，那时候他们如果没能赶回来，就托我们把这个转交给你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯平民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但你要走了，之后也不知道什么时候才能再见一面，我觉得还是现在给你比较好。你可一定要收好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉达",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉达",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这个盒子里面装着什么？这是......录像带？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉达",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还有照片......是初等学校毕业时的合照，上面还写着我和爸爸妈妈的名字......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯平民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这应该是给你的礼物吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯平民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "出了这么大的事，也不知道你父母在外头得到消息了没。唉，这么些年了，信都不往家里寄几封，真不像话！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉达",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——不是的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉达",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "爸爸妈妈只是、只是工作太忙了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉达",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯平民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，你能这么想就最好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯平民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你爸妈......他们的工作，听说也不简单。比起咱们这的事，说不定还要更难。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉达",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯平民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当年你奶奶还在的时候，有时担心得紧了，就会来和我说两句，唉......说是研究啥东西，但哪有这样连亲人的面都不给见的呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯平民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "总之，拉达你要自己好好照顾自己，不管去哪儿，都记得给奶奶报个平安。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯平民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不耽搁你们的时间了，快去吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉达",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "爸爸，妈妈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你还好吗，拉达？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉达",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......没事，没事的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉达",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉达",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "尖针大叔，我......我或许，想到之后要做什么了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_indoor_u"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉稳的男性",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拉达，好孩子，别哭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉稳的男性",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "爸爸妈妈是在做对我们乌萨斯很重要的工作，所以不能常回来陪着拉达，也没有办法经常写信回来......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉稳的男性",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但拉达绝对不是没有爸妈的孩子，你是爸爸妈妈的宝贝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年幼的女孩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是，可是......其他小朋友都说......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年幼的女孩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "说拉达是没人要的小孩......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温柔的女性",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么会呢？爸爸妈妈都很爱拉达，其他的小朋友只是一时误会了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温柔的女性",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拉达，我们或许会一时分离，会无法见面，无法通信......可能在我们想念彼此时，只有一点点回忆能够支撑我们继续走下去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温柔的女性",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没有办法陪着你长大，是爸爸妈妈的错。但是不要忘记，拉达，不要忘记爸爸妈妈会永远爱你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温柔的女性",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不管我们身在何方，不管未来拉达你选了什么样的路......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉稳的男性",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我和妈妈都会支持你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉稳的男性",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只要有机会，我们就一定会回到你身边。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "小的时候，周围有孩子笑话我是没有爸妈的野小孩。\n我很难受，哭着告诉了难得回家的爸爸妈妈。\n那之后不久，不知道为什么，小朋友们就再也没有这么笑话过我。隔壁的姐姐会轻轻摸我的头，和我说：\n“原来拉达的爸爸妈妈是很了不起的研究者，之前真是对不起呀。”\n我的爸爸妈妈，很了不起。\n但是我很少能见到他们。\n初等学校毕业那一天，爸爸妈妈回来了。\n我和爸爸妈妈一起参加毕业典礼，一起拍照，一起去很多地方玩......\n爸爸妈妈说，他们不想错过我的成长。所以不管有多难，都会努力争取，至少在重要的日子里，能陪在我身边。\n爸爸妈妈说，他们想让我了解他们的生活，所以会记录下来，留给我，在我想念他们的时候可以有更多陪伴。\n......那是不是只要我继续成长，就可以和爸爸妈妈再见面？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_corridor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉达",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼哼~哼哼哼~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉达",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真理姐，拍下来了吗？拍下来了吗？我终于通过测试啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等，拉达，你跑慢点......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼......好了，都帮你拍下来了。但是你怎么会突然开始想要拍生活记录了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉达",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......因为要多存一点我成长的记录，是一份秘密惊喜哦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉达",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，对了真理姐！现在我已经通过测试了，已经和姐姐们一样是正式干员了！要记得叫代号才行啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉达",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "古米！我的代号叫作古米！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好，古米。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......有点不习惯。拉达，这么说的话，你的自称也得纠正过来才行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对哦......！我都忘记了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "古米一定会加油的，一定会保护姐姐们，还有罗德岛的大家！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "早啊，拉达，安娜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "早上好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "尖针大叔！早上好！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不能再叫拉达了，古米有代号了，是正式干员了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，那真不错，恭喜你啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对了尖针大叔，古米有个问题想问！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？什么问题，你说说看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "罗德岛......有学校吗？古米可以继续读书吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "古米......？怎么突然提起这个......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "学校这么正式的机构肯定是没有啦，不过培训课程，还有基础教育的课程还是有的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真的？那就是可以继续读书的意思喽！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当然。你这么积极，教课的老师看到你一定会很欣慰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其实就算你不提，我估计之后也会有专门负责的干员来通知你们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士特地打过招呼，要盯着你们好好读书，到时候你们想跑估计都跑不掉！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......凛冬肯定要头疼了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈哈凛冬姐大战教头！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_room_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "爸爸妈妈......拉达现在在叫罗德岛的地方生活。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "虽然，虽然还会有一些不习惯的事情，也会有一些，想起来会害怕的事......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是和姐姐们一起的话，拉达相信一切都会变好的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "爸爸，妈妈，你们也要努力工作，我会给波琳娜奶奶写信，告诉奶奶罗德岛的联系方式......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果你们写信回来，或者直接回来找我了，波琳娜奶奶会告诉你们我去了哪，然后我们就可以在罗德岛见面啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......把我丢下这么久，在我最害怕的时候也没有出现，我也是会生气的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很生气很生气，没有那么容易就原谅你们，到时候见了面，可能会和你们吵架......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......但是吵完之后，我们也还是一家人，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要是爸爸妈妈很忙，抽不出时间......这次就换拉达去找你们，去见你们！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过现在的我还不行。现在的拉达，变了很多，可能会吓到爸爸妈妈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我会把那些......那些不太好的习惯都克服掉！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这里有很多人会帮拉达一起克服，安娜姐她们也会一起......我们一定都会忘掉那些不好的事，我们都会振作起来！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等着我哦......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拉达一定会继续努力长大的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
